ink for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Psionic_Ward\">Condition: Psionic Ward</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Ward (Condition)\">Psionic Ward</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +5 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> and can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a></span> while within 3 m (10 ft) of the spellcaster.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The tooltip incorrectly calculates the bonus as equal to the Charisma modifier (usually a +3), but in practice it is a flat +5 bonus.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Psionic_Ward_Aura\">Creatures with Psionic Ward Aura</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png/30px-Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png/45px-Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png/60px-Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ghush'ins\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png/30px-Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Portrait_Ghush%27ins.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\">Ghush'ins</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">The gish and allies within 3m (10 ft) have a +5 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> and can't be <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234404\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2446/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30535/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8245/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function 